# smart-delete — шаги записи (что показывается — smart-delete.md)
# Его сценарий 2026-10-05: выключено (Obsidian) → включено, остальные контролы выключены → по одному
# включаются Drop the line Prefix и Join with a space → Smart Backspace со всем включённым.
title Smart Delete and Backspace | Join two lines without dragging the indent and the bullet along
open Errands.md
caret - Call the plumber
stage Default Obsidian
say Obsidian: Delete pulls up the indent and the bullet too
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumber    - about the kitchen sink / - Book a table

stage Smart Delete
say Smart Delete on, its options off
settings Keyboard
set Smart Delete = on
set Drop the line Prefix = off
set Join with a space = off
caret - Call the plumber
say Delete → only the indent goes
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumber- about the kitchen sink / - Book a table

stage Drop the line Prefix
say Drop the line Prefix → on
settings Keyboard
set Drop the line Prefix = on
caret - Call the plumber
say Delete → the bullet goes too
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumberabout the kitchen sink / - Book a table

stage Join with a space
say Join with a space → on
settings Keyboard
set Join with a space = on
caret - Call the plumber
say Delete → the words join with a space
key Delete
expect ## To do / - Call the plumber about the kitchen sink / - Book a table

stage Smart Backspace
say Smart Backspace → on
settings Keyboard
set Smart Backspace = on
caret - and envelopes @ and
say Backspace at the start → the words go up the same way
key Backspace
expect - Book a table / - Buy stamps and envelopes
